{"path":"experimental/optional/swap2","title":"std::experimental::swap(std::experimental::optional)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>swap<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::experimental::optional)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/optional/swap2","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Overloads the std::swap algorithm for std::experimental::optional. Exchanges the state of lhs with that of rhs. Effectively calls lhs.swap(rhs).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/experimental/optional\">&lt;experimental/optional&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> optional<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs, optional<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see below */</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Overloads the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm for <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/optional\">std::experimental::optional</a></span>. Exchanges the state of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</